// Specifies that the `bnns_graph_t` object should be generated directly to the given file descriptor This is intended to reduce memory required for compilation, as the full set of graph weights need not be memory resident all at once This option will override any previously set output path option. The file indicated by the desriptor must be open for writing, and will be truncated and completely overwritten. If this option is used, the `bnns_graph_t` returned BNNSCompileFromFile() will be a read-only mmap'd version of the result. Passing -1 will reset to the default behavior of generating strictly in memory (or the file specified via `BNNSGraphCompileOptionsSetOutputPath`).
